  "rating": "5",
  "item_short_desc": "<p>Embrace the outdoors with our Digital Camo Boonie Hat! Crafted to government specifications, this hat offers 360-degree sun defense. The wide, structured brim shades your neck and face, keeping you cool during outdoor activities. Made from a durable 55% cotton / 45% polyester blend, these hats withstand consistent outdoor use. Branch loops allow camouflaging with surroundings&mdash;perfect for hunting and bird watching. Four screened side vents circulate air, ensuring comfort. The adjustable chin strap secures the hat during windy days.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "57858",
  "description": "<p>Embrace the outdoors with our Digital Camo Boonie Hat! Crafted to government specifications, this hat offers 360-degree sun defense. The wide, structured brim shades your neck and face, keeping you cool during outdoor activities. Made from a durable 55% cotton / 45% polyester blend, these hats withstand consistent outdoor use. Branch loops allow camouflaging with surroundings&mdash;perfect for hunting and bird watching. Four screened side vents circulate air, ensuring comfort. The adjustable chin strap secures the hat during windy days or on-the-go adventures. Dominate the sun with Rothco's Boonie Hat.</p>",
